{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……真難搞。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2578", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我想也是。我也不覺得瓜生君會那麼輕易就投降。」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5377", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然明白，但是連告白都沒辦法。」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2579", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺我要開口時他就逃跑。好像鰻魚一樣。」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2580", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「告白對象是鰻魚啊……」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5378", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「當葛格是很好，要交往的話防禦力是鐵壁。」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2581", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是妳不打算放棄吧？」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5379", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2582", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「必須想下一招呢。」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5380", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「早上去叫醒他，突然告白。」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2583", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「雖然這樣他一定得聽，不過會認真看待嗎？」", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5381", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……半夜偷偷爬到床上。」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2584", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「告白前……櫻乃辦得到呢。但是，那樣子有意義嗎？」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5382", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「用手機告白。」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2585", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「用電話講好像會跟當面對話有相同的結果。」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5383", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「用郵件告白。」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2586", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果他說沒看到或是沒收到呢？」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5384", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊唔……或許沒其他方法了。」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2587", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「櫻乃，妳想得太偏執了。」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5385", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那愛理會怎麼做？」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2588", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5386", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼做？」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2589", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那個，我想想……黃昏的頂樓之類的。」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5387", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「結女不能上去頂樓吧？」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2590", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「黃昏的海邊，之類的。」", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5388", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要去海邊很遠喔。」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2591", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「黃昏的──」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5389", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「愛理喜歡黃昏？」", "text_idx": 267, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2592", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我也太偏執了呢。」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5390", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但告白不是都感覺在黃昏時刻嗎？」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5391", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，沒錯。」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2593", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不過實際上並不一定是啦。」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5392", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「一起出去玩的時候，或是回家的時候？」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2594", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「浪漫的情境又不常見，所以一般都不是在那種狀況吧。」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5393", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我的話，就是一起吃飯的時候、去葛格的房間玩的時候吧。」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2595", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5394", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2596", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「感覺一點也不夢幻呢。」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5395", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，是啊。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2597", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是瓜生君好像會若無其事地開口。」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5396", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好像是。」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2598", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果被他告白妳怎麼辦？」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5397", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被葛格？大概……不可能。」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2599", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是的，那樣還怎麼聊，我是說如果啦。」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5398", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯……」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2600", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果被告白的話，一定會嚇一跳。」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2601", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「以不嚇一跳為前提的櫻乃才是最讓我驚訝的。」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 320, "voice": "ar5399", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不實際發生我不知道。或許我會嚇到拒絕他。」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2602", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2603", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "鞋子在。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "葛格回家了啊。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2604", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "怎麼辦？雖然跟愛理聊了很多，但結果還是沒想到好主意。", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……豁出去？」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2605", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "與其做奇怪的事情，或許把心裡的話直接說出來比較好。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯，就這樣。」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2606", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要是失敗吃飯的時候會很尷尬，還是晚飯後──", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "有電話。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「喂，我是瓜生。」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2607", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『喔，是親愛的女兒，太好了。』", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0000", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爸爸。」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2608", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『抱歉一直讓妳這麼辛苦。』", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0001", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不要緊，葛格也在。」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2609", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『這麼說來，新吾怎麼樣了？好久沒跟他說話了。』", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0002", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爸爸好冷淡。」", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2610", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『對兒子手下留情怎麼行？』", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0003", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『爸爸跟兒子就是這樣的吧，因為兒子是總有一天要打倒爸爸的存在。』", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0004", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爸爸跟葛格沒有血緣關係。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是爸爸一直把葛格當成兒子來對待。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "葛格也知道，而且把他當成真正的爸爸相處。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟媽媽也一樣。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "家人的話……就很簡單的說。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『嗯，怎麼了？開玩笑的。我不會跟新吾對決的妳放心吧。』", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0005", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「葛格的話，一定能和平解決。」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2611", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……我想也是。』", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0006", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爸爸呵呵笑著。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且要對決的話，我是站在葛格這邊的。」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2612", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『真是的，身為爸爸這種時候好悲傷啊……』", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0007", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『看來你們相處得很好。』", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0008", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，感情要好的兄妹。」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2613", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『那就好。』", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0009", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『要是背著爸媽做什麼壞事，就要把你們趕出去了說。』", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0010", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「欸……」", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2614", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『怎麼，心虛嗎？』", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0011", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒有，真可惜。」", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2615", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『可惜……妳要當兄控是可以，但是偶爾也想起爸爸吧。』", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0012", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「沒問題，我總是在遙遠的藍天下祈禱你平安無事。」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2616", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『遙遠是怎麼樣？算了，沒回家的我也沒資格說這些。』", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0013", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『工作的事再一陣子就會告一段落了，到時就配合媽媽的行程一起回去喔。』", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0014", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我會不抱期待的期待。」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2617", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『不愧是當我女兒這麼多年了很懂嘛。那我有空再打回來。』", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0015", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爸爸，不要勉強自己喔。」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2618", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『好，要是有什麼事……有新吾在所以沒關係吧。』", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0016", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "父", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『如果有什麼煩惱，隨時都可以打給我喔。』", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "父親", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "fa0017", "char_id": "父"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，我會的。」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2619", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2620", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "背著父母……", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "沒錯。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果我跟葛格兩情相悅了，該怎麼跟爸爸和媽媽說呢？", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "爸爸跟媽媽應該不會反對……我覺得。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但只是我覺得，實際上還不知道。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sk2621", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "切身感受到愛理說的「跟普通不同」了。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sakuno_route01_15.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "跟葛格交往不是只有我們自己的問題。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
